usage: run_svhn.py [-h] [--data-root DATA_ROOT] [--output-root OUTPUT_ROOT]
                   [--device {cuda,cuda:0}] [--download]
                   [--stop-after-epoch STOP_AFTER_EPOCH]
                   [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT]
                   {check,run,resume}

One hundred COMPLETE train-only SVHN epochs, starting from scratch.
Production: CUDA, complete official train only, no extra, no MX, no new
quantizer. The supplied Any-Precision forward function and the validated epoch
loop are reused. Run starts fresh; resume is only for interrupted runs of THIS
full-run package.

positional arguments:
  {check,run,resume}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data-root DATA_ROOT
  --output-root OUTPUT_ROOT
  --device {cuda,cuda:0}
  --download
  --stop-after-epoch STOP_AFTER_EPOCH
                        Vast eindpunt 100; gecontroleerd onderbreken kan met
                        een enkele Ctrl+C.
  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT
